The tick halts the machine only once the count has passed the watchdog's deadline, a tick after it reached it;
the tick that reaches the deadline halts the machine.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: the machine runs past the watchdog's deadline

diff --git a/kernel/sched.c b/kernel/sched.c
--- a/kernel/sched.c
+++ b/kernel/sched.c
@@ -511,7 +511,7 @@ static void tick_advance(uint32_t ticks)
         }
     }
     if (watchdog.armed) {
-        if (!tick_before(sched_ticks, watchdog.deadline)) {
+        if (tick_before(watchdog.deadline, sched_ticks)) {
             kputs("watchdog: not fed in time\n");
             khalt(7);
         }
